message: If you use Atelier, please cite it as below.
title: "Atelier: Open-source Claude Design / Artifacts alternative"
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Shiyu
    alias: liush2yuxjtu
    affiliation: "Xi'an Jiaotong University"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/liush2yuxjtu/atelier"
abstract: >-
  Atelier is an MIT-licensed, self-hostable Next.js design canvas:
  chat plus infinite multi-artboard HTML artboards, linked Tweaks,
  Design Components (.dc.html), and BYOK for Anthropic, OpenAI,
  OpenRouter, or OpenAI-compatible endpoints. Inspired by the
  interaction shape of Claude Artifacts and Claude Design; not
  affiliated with Anthropic.
keywords:
  - AI design
  - Claude Design alternative
  - Claude Artifacts
  - infinite canvas
  - design components
  - BYOK
  - Next.js
  - open source
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-01"
